    "excerpt": "Your complete pre-departure checklist for an EV road trip across Asia. From essential cables and apps to thermal prep, backup charging plans, and what to pack for emergencies — designed for Thailand, Malaysia, Singapore, Japan, South Korea, Vietnam, Indonesia, and the Philippines.",
