    "excerpt": "South Korea has one of the densest EV charging networks in Asia. Guide to networks (EV Infra, KEPCO, SK Signet, Hyundai E-Pit), expressway charging at every rest stop, Seoul metro coverage, costs, and the best EV road trips including Seoul-Busan, Seoul-Sokcho, and the southern flavors loop.",
