    "excerpt": "Comprehensive guide to EV road trips in Japan for 2026. Covers charging networks (CHAdeMO vs CCS2), best routes from Tokyo to Hakone, Osaka to Kyoto, and Hokkaido, rental EV companies, toll costs, and essential apps.",
