    "title": "Bangkok to Phuket EV Road Trip Guide: Charging Stops, Costs & Family Tips [2026]",
    "excerpt": "Complete guide to driving an EV from Bangkok to Phuket in 2026. Route planning along Highway 4, charging stops at PEA Volta stations, cost comparison vs flying, and family-friendly island activities.",
