    "title": "Osaka, Kyoto & Nara EV Road Trip: The Perfect Kansai Electric Getaway",
    "excerpt": "Explore Japan's cultural heart by electric car. This complete guide covers EV charging across the Kansai region — Osaka, Kyoto, and Nara — with CHAdeMO stations, budget hotels, family-friendly temples, and cost comparisons vs Japan Rail.",
