    "title": "Phnom Penh to Siem Reap EV Road Trip: Angkor Wat by Electric Car [2026]",
    "excerpt": "Complete guide to driving an EV from Phnom Penh to Siem Reap in 2026. Charging stops along National Highway 6, Angkor Wat temple access, family-friendly activities, and what to expect from Cambodia's growing EV infrastructure.",
