    "excerpt": "The complete family guide to driving Taiwan's west coast by EV from Taipei to Kaohsiung. Day-by-day itinerary via Taichung's science museums, Sun Moon Lake's cable cars, Tainan's historical sites, and Kaohsiung's harbour. Charging stops, family activities, and seasonal tips for Taiwan's EV-friendly highways.",
