    "title": "Taiwan EV Road Trip Guide 2026 — Taipei to Kaohsiung, Hualien Coast, and Charging Infrastructure",
    "excerpt": "Taiwan's EV infrastructure is booming with over 10,000 charging stations. This guide covers everything from Taipei to Kaohsiung on Highway 1, the stunning Hualien coastal route, and essential apps for navigating Taiwan's charging network.",
    "date": "2026-05-14",
