    "title": "EV Winter Driving in Japan and Korea: Complete Guide for 2026",
    "excerpt": "Everything EV owners need to know about winter driving in Japan and Korea. Range loss, battery pre-conditioning, winter tyres, charging in snow, and route planning for Hokkaido, Nagano, Seoul, and Pyeongchang.",
    "date": "2026-05-13",
    "author": "EV Charging Asia Team",
