    "title": "Singapore to Kuala Lumpur EV Road Trip — Complete Family Guide",
    "excerpt": "The complete family guide to driving an EV from Singapore to Kuala Lumpur via Malacca. Charging stops, kid-friendly activities, border crossing tips, and cost comparisons for a stress-free cross-border road trip.",
